  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "DSH Pin-Sessions Plugin",
      "text": "A [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/dsh) (DSH) web plugin that lets users **pin sessions** to a dedicated sidebar section for quick access to recurring workflows, and provides an **archive-sessions** settings panel with batch delete, restore, workspace grouping, and pagination."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- **Pin / Unpin sessions** — Pin sessions to the top of the sidebar, hidden from their workspace browser\n- **Archive panel** — Settings panel for managing archived sessions with batch delete, per-row restore, workspace grouping, and 20-per-page pagination\n- **Context menu integration** — Right-click pin/unpin via `@baihejiangnan/dsh-session-context-menu`\n- **Pin = Archive** — Pinning archives the session from the workspace browser; unpinning restores it"
    },
    {
      "section": "Architecture",
      "text": "Standard DSH plugin split: **host half** (Cordis loader entry + TYPERT manifest) + **client half** (`window.__ModuleLoader__.load` wrapper)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Host Side",
      "text": "| File | Responsibility |\n|------|---------------|\n| `src/index.ts` | Opens `pin_sessions` storage domain, creates `PinsStore` + `PinsRuntime` |\n| `src/runtime.ts` | `PinsRuntime extends TypertRemoteService` — 8 TYPERT methods |\n| `src/typert.ts` | Host TYPERT manifest (must match client) |\n| `src/store.ts` | Durable pin store over the `pin_sessions` domain |\n| `src/domain.ts` | `pin_sessions` domain declaration |\n| `src/schemas.ts` | Zod schemas for pin records |"
    },
    {
      "section": "TYPERT Methods",
      "text": "`list`, `pin`, `unpin`, `toggle`, `isPinned`, `deleteSessions`, `listArchived`, `unarchiveSession`"
    },
    {
      "section": "Key Design: Pin = Archive",
      "text": "Pinning calls `workspaceRegistry.archiveSession(sessionId)` to hide the session from the workspace browser. Unpinning calls `unarchiveSession()` which removes the ID from `archivedSessionIds`. This triggers `domain/changed` → `host/archived-sessions-changed` frame → client auto-updates."
    },
    {
      "section": "Client Side",
      "text": "| File | Responsibility |\n|------|---------------|\n| `src/client/index.ts` | Registers locale, mounts TYPERT_REMOTE, context-menu extensions, portals PinnedSection + ArchiveSection |\n| `src/client/PinPanel.tsx` | Pinned section portaled to top of sidebar |\n| `src/client/ArchivePanel.tsx` | Settings panel with workspace grouping, pagination, batch delete, restore |\n| `src/client/styles.ts` | CSS mirroring native DSH classes |\n| `src/client/locales.ts` | i18n strings |\n| `src/client/remote.ts` | TYPERT remote interface |\n| `src/client/typert-remote.ts` | Client TYPERT manifest (must match host) |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Build & Install",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "Build",
      "text": "cd dsh-pin-sessions\npnpm install\npnpm run build        # tsc + tsdown + wrap-client.mjs"
    },
    {
      "section": "Typecheck",
      "text": "pnpm run typecheck"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install into DSH",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /path/to/dsh-pin-sessions\n```\n\n- Host-side changes require DSH server restart\n- Client-side changes require browser refresh"
    },
    {
      "section": "Key Service Access Patterns",
      "text": "| Service | Usage |\n|---------|-------|\n| `ctx.get(\"workspaceRegistry\")` | `archiveSession()`, `archivedSessionIds`, `list()`, `enqueueOperation()`, `setState()` |\n| `ctx.get(\"sessionPersistence\")` | `list()` returns headers with `{id, cwd?, origin?}` |\n| `ctx.get(\"sessions\")` | `get(id)` returns live session or undefined |\n| `ctx.get(\"agents\")` | `get(id)` returns agent with `cancel()` and `whenIdle()` |\n| `ctx.get(\"storageDomain\")` | `get(\"session_projcache\")` for projection cache |\n| `GlobalStandardProps` | Auto-injects `useSessions` and `useWorkspaces` hooks |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Context Menu Integration",
      "text": "`@baihejiangnan/dsh-session-context-menu` exposes a global registry at `Symbol.for(\"dsh.session-context-menu.extensions\")` with `.register(entry)`. The plugin may load after us, so we poll every 500ms until the registry appears.\n\nEntries: `{id, label, order?, visible?, run}`. The context menu's `isAction()` checks for \"会话\"+\"操作\" or \"session\"+\"action\" in `aria-label`; `titleFrom()` extracts the quoted title."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
